---

`POST /v1/installation-requests/redeem`

The registered app backend authenticates with a signed client assertion and a single-use code. Plaintext is returned only once; retries return status and never create another credential.

<Tabs>
<Tab title="TypeScript">
```typescript TypeScript
photon.system.redeemAppInstallationDelivery(input: RedeemAppInstallationDeliveryInput, options?: RequestOptions): Promise<RedeemAppInstallationDeliveryOutput>
```
</Tab>
