```
</Tab>
<Tab title="Rust">
```rust Rust
client.redeem_app_installation_delivery(body: &types::RedeemAppInstallationDeliveryRequest).await -> Result<ResponseValue<types::RedeemAppInstallationDeliveryResponse>, Error<RedeemAppInstallationDeliveryError>>
```
